# Upstream releases are the signed tags vX.Y.Z on GitHub. The pattern
# takes final versions only (digits and dots), never a pre-release tag;
# uscan links the download as zark_X.Y.Z.orig.tar.gz. Format version 5
# is read by the uscan of Ubuntu 26.04 (devscripts 2.26.7) and later, not
# by 24.04's (2.23.7); no build reads this file.
Version: 5

Source: https://github.com/juanmitaboada/zark/tags
Matching-Pattern: (?:.*?/)?v?(\d[\d.]*)\.tar\.gz
